{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"738914113043955833","content":"There are 5 stations also with the option to stay behind to repair/deal with on board issues\n\nstations 1 and 2 deal with cannons on the left and right sides\n\nstation 3 are front cannons\n\nstation 4 are back mines to launch behind\n\nstation 5 is to stay on board, repairing systems, putting out fires, patching leaks or anything that may crawl aboard\n\nMines for station 4: The oaken bolter launches an explosive charge at a point within 120 feet. Each creature within 20 feet of that point must make a DC 15 Dexterity saving throw, taking 17 (5d6) fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nCannon damage: Lancing Bolt. Melee or Ranged Weapon Attack: +7 to hit, reach 5 ft. or range 100/400 ft., one target. Hit: 15 (2d10 + 4) piercing damage.\nstation 5 healing/repairs\nd6 repairs unless have mending then they gain 2d6 to heal","created_at":"2020-08-01T01:53:48.979000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738937500772466759","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
